  "steps": [
    "Finely chop the cabbage, then the cucumber, and add both to a large bowl.",
    "Finely chop the chives and add them to the bowl.",
    "In a blender, add the garlic, shallot, a handful of chives, lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Add the cashews, basil, spinach and nutritional yeast, then blend until completely smooth and bright green.",
